        "client_msg_id": "534865D5-5505-40EB-B7D1-BD441BD79FE9",
        "text": "Seems to me that what we really need is a way to run libraries with minimal privileges as a matter of course.\n\nPerhaps WASM will let us do this. I think WASM has enough virtues that it will become the dominant way to deploy business logic in the nearish future.",
